      "writtenOn": "2021-03-04T21:59:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we have this limit? 16mbps is exceeded by some audio formats, and those probably won\u0027t be used by this, but should we save those bits here? We can\u0027t extend these bits to mean something else later (and anyway we want each field/type to represent only one thing at this layer)",
